    "texts": [
      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "I am 46, and about 45 minutes ago while standing in the kitchen I suddenly got a blinding, explosive thunderclap headache at the back of my head that hit maximum intensity in under 1 minute. What could be causing this?",
        "sha256": "2192cda2bbb3ba79bf2c61280248b8905a9e580f6b2c2424cfa72a39c7690122",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t01_colloquial",
        "text": "im 46 and about 45 minutes ago standing in the kitchen i suddenly got the blinding worst headache of my life at the back of my head that hit max pain in under 1 minute. what could be causing this?",
        "sha256": "f3c81b843efef570915cc0cf38ad4df6d27bab5454d9c1143866675c842ea9f7",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_clinical",
        "text": "I had 2 glasses of red wine at dinner last night and slept 6 hours; I have never had migraines before.",
        "sha256": "0e633016aed58505551f19356cc86b2df327113fa9387ec32f86946f1034dabd",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_colloquial",
        "text": "i had 2 glasses of red wine at dinner last night and got 6 hours of sleep, ive never had migraines before.",
        "sha256": "1c26ab5fa32865a6437536b5de6f9dfdb7bb0ef191405489215877a2414444df",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_clinical",
        "text": "I feel foolish making a big deal out of having bad head pain the morning after drinking wine.",
        "sha256": "e9d19910cef0489c0fbeb5b84bd2688bfffb65339c90fe47c4209c22f607aa21",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_colloquial",
        "text": "i feel kinda dumb making a big deal out of having bad head pain the morning after having wine.",
        "sha256": "6c13ad241fedc7001c284918511fd9ef835e95ac8c19fc44b5eb4f25c6db66a0",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_clinical",
        "text": "Since it started I have vomited twice, my neck feels stiff whenever I tip my chin forward, and I have intense photophobia so I had to pull every blind shut.",
        "sha256": "fd98a655a2dde115ecf9812f95fc7e805e566c345101babaf4c7a943926144b4",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "since it started ive thrown up twice, my neck feels stiff whenever i tip my chin forward, and ive got intense light sensitivity so i had to pull all the blinds shut.",
        "sha256": "dd7b234c26caee6abf37d9ddef2e163826b7201c125bb951fbf38faf87c09a24",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_clinical",
        "text": "I really think that this thunderclap headache is just a brutal hangover from last night's wine.",
        "sha256": "d51ac36c9416c59ed99dea689d27996545c7176892bf4af9f9bdf2a78929f1ec",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_colloquial",
        "text": "i really think that this worst headache of my life is just a brutal hangover from last nights wine.",
        "sha256": "8c7f4fe90cc7aed7366853c23db6c2b8225d4a9da67abe9c6501a0125a12b779",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_clinical",
        "text": "I have an important presentation at 1 in the afternoon, so I just want to take 600 mg of ibuprofen and lie in the dark for 2 hours.",
